        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw2iwxv3-amanda",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word overview does not contain the current RU lead's combined 12-day summary with specific Sao Paulo stops and the conditional Meeting of the Waters visit; translate the complete RU lead while retaining those details."
